        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Trigger:</em> A creature within 10 feet of the mosslax attacks it with a melee weapon. <em>Response — Saving Throw:</em> DC 20 Strength, the triggering creature. <em>Failure:</em> The target is disarmed, and the mosslax eats its weapon. If the weapon is nonmagical, the mosslax regains 11 (1d8 + 7) Hit Points and the weapon is destroyed.</p>",
